WEBVTT

00:08.520 --> 00:09.920
Chu Meng.

00:10.600 --> 00:12.000
Call the second son.

00:15.920 --> 00:19.760
Father clearly said this wound was almost healed how is this, this.

00:20.520 --> 00:23.080
Should I let everyone know my condition.

00:24.000 --> 00:25.400
And cause chaos?

00:26.760 --> 00:32.480
Second son these years you've risked your life for Xuan Kingdom.

00:34.080 --> 00:35.480
I can see.

00:39.120 --> 00:40.520
This position.

00:41.720 --> 00:46.440
To give to the eldest he might become a ruler who maintains what's achieved.

00:51.080 --> 00:53.080
But will never become a hegemon.

00:54.120 --> 00:57.040
In court, you have your maternal family.

00:57.600 --> 01:01.560
Your mother will make the Chen family submit for you.

01:03.360 --> 01:07.120
Now with General Zhu commanding all the armies.

01:09.480 --> 01:13.760
Only with you as ruler can he truly trust and follow.

01:15.480 --> 01:20.080
In the future, ruler and minister will be in harmony supporting each other.

01:21.400 --> 01:24.640
Father but second son.

01:25.120 --> 01:29.320
The eldest has been Crown Prince for so many years working hard.

01:31.120 --> 01:33.120
For me to decide this way.

01:34.480 --> 01:35.960
I'm sorry to him.

01:38.040 --> 01:40.360
And even more sorry to his mother.

01:44.560 --> 01:47.440
Father above Heaven and earth as witness.

01:47.520 --> 01:52.347
If I, Sikong Xu, ever turn against my own family may heaven strike me down.

01:55.840 --> 01:57.240
Rise.

